{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I heard the voice of many angels
Around the throne, ten thou[Cm]sand times ten thousand
And all the living creatures [Ab]and the elders
Singing with a [Eb]loud voice [Bb]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Eb]Worthy is the Lamb who was [Cm]slain
[Cm7/Bb]To receive [Ab]power and [Eb]riches and [Bb]wisdom
And [Ab]strength and [Bb]honor and [Eb]glo[Bb/D]ry and [Cm]bles[Cm7/Bb]sing [Ab]
[Bb]Worthy is the [Eb]Lamb
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
To [Ab]him who [Bb]sits upon the [Cm]throne
And [Cm7/Bb]to the [Ab]Lamb
Be [Bb]blessing and [Cm]honor and glory and [Ab]power
Forever and [Bb]ever
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Eb]Worthy is the Lamb who was [Cm]slain
[Cm7/Bb]To receive [Ab]power and [Eb]riches and [Bb]wisdom
